{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/BlenderRNA Registry.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/BlenderRNA Registry.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender rna registry blender rna registry","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/BlenderRNA Registry.md","fileName":"BlenderRNA Registry.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"BlenderRNA Registry","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender RNA Data Architecture]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender RNA Data Architecture","Blender StructRNA","Blender RNA Definition API","Blender SDNA Metadata","Blender RNA Access API","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/BlenderRNA Registry.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/BlenderRNA Registry.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender rna registry blender rna registry","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/BlenderRNA Registry.md","fileName":"BlenderRNA Registry.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"BlenderRNA Registry","heading":"BlenderRNA Registry","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"`BlenderRNA` is the root record containing all registered RNA structure types. It stores a list of [[Blender StructRNA]] objects, a hash from public identifiers to those structures, and a count that also accounts for types not entered into the public-name map.\n\nThe [[Blender RNA Definition API]] creates this registry during generation and derives its view of serializable layouts from [[Blender SDNA Metadata]]. Generated global structure descriptions then populate the runtime interface used by the [[Blender RNA Access API]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender RNA Data Architecture","Blender StructRNA","Blender RNA Definition API","Blender SDNA Metadata","Blender RNA Access API","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"